WEBVTT

video-title-preparation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.202
Nkwadebe

preparation-01
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.100
Buru ụzọ saa aka ma hichaa ha.

preparation-02
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Gbanye ìhè BIO. Pịa bọtịnụ ugboro ise ka ìhè sie ike karịa.

preparation-03
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Ngwaọrụ ahụ na-agbanyụ onwe ya mgbe sekọnd iri itoolu gasịrị.

preparation-04
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Yiri BIO n'isi. Hazie eriri ka ọ kwụsie ike ma dị mma n'isi.

preparation-05
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.700
Debe etiti ya n'ahịrị imi. Gbatịa aka lee mkpịsị aka ukwu na anya otu otu iji chọpụta nhazi.

preparation-06
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:47.100
Tụgharịa ebe nlele anya n'èzí ka ha bụrụ ogo iri itoolu n'ahịrị nlele mgbe i lere ntakịrị ala.

video-title-fundoscopy-sitting
00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:48.081
Nnyocha ime azụ anya mgbe onye ọrịa nọ ọdụ

sitting-01
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.900
Meghee oghere ojii anya onye ọrịa ka ị hụ ime azụ anya nke ọma na nke sara mbara.

sitting-02
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:08.500
Jide lens nso anya. Welie mkpuchi elu, tụkwasị mkpịsị aka ndị ọzọ nwayọọ n'elu nkuanya na ntì.

sitting-03
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:16.300
Jide lens n'ogologo aka, n'ahịrị ìhè na retina. Onyinyo n'ọnụ ya na-egosi nhazi na-adịghị mma.

sitting-04
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:22.000
Iji lelee ọnụ retina, gwa onye ọrịa ka o lee n'akụkụ dị iche iche.

sitting-05
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.700
Ọ dị mkpa? Ka o lekwasị mkpịsị aka ya anya n'ogologo aka.

sitting-06
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.200
Mgbe macula gasịrị, lelee akụkụ anọ nke fundus dị n'akụkụ.

video-title-fundoscopy-indentation
00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:33.727
Nnyocha ime azụ anya site na ịpị

indentation-01
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:42.000
Buru ụzọ gwa ya: ọ nwere ike inye nsogbu.

indentation-02
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.500
Gwa ya ka o lee n'akụkụ ọzọ. Debe ihe na-apị n'elu ebe a na-enyocha.

indentation-03
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Gwa ya ka o lee ebe a na-enyocha, wee pịa nwayọọ.

indentation-04
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.800
Nke a bụ nlele retina dị n'elu.

indentation-05
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.200
Debe ìhè, lens na retina n'ahịrị otu.

indentation-06
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:10.600
Ị ga-enwe ike inyocha ọnụ retina dị anya nke ukwuu.
